{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":58,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the chief Musician, Al-taschith, Michtam of David.","tok":[{"t":"To the chief "},{"t":"Musician","s":["H5329"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Al-taschith","s":["H0516"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Michtam","s":["H4387"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":1,"text":"Do ye indeed speak righteousness, O congregation? do ye judge uprightly, O ye sons of men?","tok":[{"t":"Do ye "},{"t":"indeed","s":["H0552"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"congregation","s":["H0482"],"a":[1]},{"t":"? do ye "},{"t":"judge","s":["H8199"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"uprightly","s":["H4339"],"a":[4]},{"t":", O ye "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[7]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":2,"text":"Yea, in heart ye work wickedness; ye weigh the violence of your hands in the earth.","tok":[{"t":"Yea, in "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[1]},{"t":" ye "},{"t":"work","s":["H6466"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H5766"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; ye "},{"t":"weigh","s":["H6424"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"violence","s":["H2555"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The wicked are estranged from the womb: they go astray as soon as they be born, speaking lies.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"estranged","s":["H2114"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"womb","s":["H7358"],"a":[2]},{"t":": they go "},{"t":"astray","s":["H8582"],"a":[3]},{"t":" as soon as they be "},{"t":"born","s":["H0990"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"speaking","s":["H1696"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"lies","s":["H3577"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Their poison is like the poison of a serpent: they are like the deaf adder that stoppeth her ear;","tok":[{"t":"Their "},{"t":"poison","s":["H2534"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"like","s":["H1823"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"poison","s":["H2534"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"serpent","s":["H5175"],"a":[4]},{"t":": they are like the "},{"t":"deaf","s":["H2795"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"adder","s":["H6620"],"a":[6]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"stoppeth","s":["H0331"],"a":[8]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0241"],"a":[9]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":5,"text":"Which will not hearken to the voice of charmers, charming never so wisely.","tok":[{"t":"Which will not "},{"t":"hearken","s":["H8085"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"charmers","s":["H3907"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"charming","s":["H2266"],"a":[5]},{"t":" never so "},{"t":"wisely","s":["H2449"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Break their teeth, O God, in their mouth: break out the great teeth of the young lions, O LORD.","tok":[{"t":"Break","s":["H2040"],"a":[1]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"teeth","s":["H8127"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":", in their "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[3]},{"t":": break "},{"t":"out","s":["H5422"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the great "},{"t":"teeth","s":["H4459"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the young "},{"t":"lions","s":["H3715"],"a":[5]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Let them melt away as waters which run continually: when he bendeth his bow to shoot his arrows, let them be as cut in pieces.","tok":[{"t":"Let them melt "},{"t":"away","s":["H3988"],"a":[0]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[2]},{"t":" which run "},{"t":"continually","s":["H1980"],"a":[3]},{"t":": when he "},{"t":"bendeth","s":["H1869"],"a":[5]},{"t":" his bow to shoot his "},{"t":"arrows","s":["H2671"],"a":[6]},{"t":", let them be as cut in "},{"t":"pieces","s":["H4135"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"As a snail which melteth, let every one of them pass away: like the untimely birth of a woman, that they may not see the sun.","tok":